terms.s2:
The QR-Codex (QR generator service) is a subscription service for creating, designing, managing and analysing QR codes. It lets you:

- choose from 16 QR code types: website, PDF, list of links, vCard, business, video, images, Facebook, Instagram, social media, WhatsApp/SMS, MP3, menu, apps, coupon and Wi-Fi;
- create dynamic codes whose destination can be edited after the code has been printed or shared;
- customize codes with logos, colours, frames and backgrounds, and download them as PNG, JPG, SVG, PDF or EPS;
- generate landing pages for your codes;
- view scan analytics and manage your codes, team and billing from a central dashboard; and
- on the plans that include them, create many codes at once from a file and connect your own software through our API.

Features and plan limits may differ between plans and may change over time. Where a feature is described as available on a particular plan, it is available only on that plan.

